 <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/sushiblade-hub/%E6%81%8B%E6%98%8F%E5%B4%8E%E5%BA%97%E5%BA%97%E4%B8%BBwith%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A4%E3%83%95%E3%83%AB/medium.jpg" width="300px" alt="medium.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>光臨！！！歡迎來到闇壽司戀昏崎店！</p> <p>Oh！客人你對闇壽司有興趣嗎？</p> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">👉你、你在講啥？</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">　</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>裝傻也沒有用哦。人家從你身上感到闇的氣息了呢。</p> <p>如果你想離開的話，先吃掉這堆油魚才能走喔。</p> <p>怎樣，是不是想知道闇壽司了？</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">👉好、好的</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">　</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>Welcome！那人家告訴你闇壽司的事喔。</p> <p>這裡你可以隨意看看。</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tabview-69ba26925d4518ed49da6e5e91ab35e8" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>菜單</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>闇壽司陀螺玩家</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>闇壽司圖錄</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>力量的使用法</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0